-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T11:54:08-08:00","id":303563,"title":"","content":"Wardens (for spirits but Wardens nonetheless)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T12:41:06-08:00","id":303642,"title":"","content":"Slashers with a cause.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T12:41:11-08:00","id":303643,"title":"","content":"Forsaken. Lost. Alone. Hunted. <br /> <br /> Angry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T12:45:24-08:00","id":303645,"title":"","content":"Context: <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> &quot;You? Hunt us? Arrogant mongrels! You are too few; we are legions. You must be born to the flesh; we take the flesh at our whim. O you wolves howl your fear to the uncaring moon, for she has given you up to us!&quot;<br /> <br /> The world is in shadow. To one side stretches the forest, to the other the city. Your claws are stained with blood. Your senses whisper of prey that runs before you, and of predators who stalk even the likes of you. You hear the howls of your brothers and sisters. Luna rises. Your blood boils. It is time to hunt.<br /> <br /> The world hates you. This isn't a figurative thing - the world doesn't acknowledge your innate right to exist. You're a half-flesh half-spirit abomination that shouldn't be. Shadowy entities hate and hunt you because you're what keeps them from building their own little hell-kingdoms in the world of man. Spiders and rats dig into people's brain and hearts, controlling them the way people drive cars. Wolves stalk your children and friends because of some sin your ancestors committed thousands of years and at least one apocalypse ago. People fear you, and would hate you if they knew what you are, if they knew you sometimes look at them and can't help thinking &quot;food&quot;.<br /> <br /> The world hates you, and does everything it can to kill you. <br /> <br /> Doesn't that make you angry?<br /> <br /> Show them how strong the Forsaken are. It is time to hunt. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-05T14:34:13-08:00","id":303747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"